# Butler Routes - Azshara (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (22 quests, docs/azshara-horde-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The seven off-zone
# accepts (Belgrom's Betrayed opener, the three city Payment legs, the three
# Remote Contact pointers) and the broken Deadliest Catch record stay out with
# reasons in the census. No race, class or profession gates: nothing contracted
# is locked, and no skill fields exist in the pool. The object-started Betrayed
# leg rides a normal accept at the placed Tome. Accepts whose pres sit outside
# every pack contract ride dedicated `when onquest` mini-steps, each standing
# alone. Expedition legs and turn-ins (Orgrimmar, Undercity, Thunder Bluff,
# Magatha's record zone) switch frames deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara-horde
title Azshara (Horde)
levels 44-50
zone Azshara
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step West hub - Jediga, Kurll and Izvi

  zone map 1447

  tip Jediga (22.56, 51.42) holds the west hub; Kurll (21.82, 52.1) hires hunters next door; Izvi Gildfizz (22.46, 51.89) pays for beach salvage.
  accept 3517 -- Stealing Knowledge - Jediga; four tablets, center ruins
  accept 91488 -- Home on the Range - Kurll; Mosshoof hides, south
  accept 91568 -- Long Walks on the Beach - Izvi Gildfizz; treasure fragments, center-east
  accept 91569 -- Blue Gold - Izvi Gildfizz; a siphoning wand, east camp

step Betrayed opener (soft pre)

  zone map 1447

  when onquest 3504

  tip Holding 3504 (Betrayed, from Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar at 75.23, 34.24): Ag'tor Bloodfist (22.26, 51.48) takes the accusation at the west hub; the Kaldorei Tome (59.51, 31.3) closes it, east camp.
  accept 3505 -- Betrayed - Ag'tor Bloodfist; Reclaimers and Surveyors, east camp
  turnin 3505 -- Betrayed - the findings to the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning

